    "sub_ename": "FORUM FOR TAIWANESE BUSINESS ADVANTAGES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程針對學員需要，選擇具有當前經營管理重要意義的議題，邀請相關專家學者引言，其目的在建立討論的平台，經由實務經驗與學術理論的對話，不同產業觀察的角度，釐清當前經營管理的重大議題。",
    "describe_eh": "For fulfilling the practicing needs and wants of the students, the course plays as a platform of academic-practical dialog. The most current business issues will be introduced through the most specialist and academician and be discussed in a frame of different views of business point in the hope that the issues will be clarified in a further way.",
    "pre_subname": "",
